This product provides an architecture-only reference for a method developed
from the Dinomaly reconstruction architecture:

  Dinomaly: The Less Is More Philosophy in Multi-Class Unsupervised
  Anomaly Detection, CVPR 2025.
  https://github.com/guojiajeremy/Dinomaly

Dinomaly is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The public OCLR
files describe route conditioning, local-only Q/V LoRA, and the shared
FP16-safe decoder block family. The end-to-end experiment pipeline is not
included.

